# Ignore node_modules everywhere – dependencies are installed inside the container
**/node_modules

# Build artifacts
**/dist
**/.next
**/build

# Git & IDE
**/.git
**/.vscode
**/.vs
**/.idea

# Docker files (avoid recursive context)
**/docker-compose*
**/compose.y*ml

# Env files
**/.env

# Misc
**/.cache
**/.turbo
**/npm-debug.log
**/README.md
**/LICENSE
